/*
  Localizable.strings — Sunnie Days (English)

  Every string here is checked against the tone rules in
  Documentation/01_Product/TONE_COPY_AND_BEHAVIOR.md by
  `CopyToneTests`, which fails the build on shaming, guilt, or
  fake-urgency language.

  Two vocabulary rules to keep when editing:
  - A task past its date is "waiting", never "overdue" or "late".
  - Care is something a plant "may be ready" for, never something the
    user "must" do.
*/

